/-!
# Literal retained conditional expectation = coarse/Doob boundary projection

The #4942 ordered route uses the literal conditional expectation onto the
sigma-algebra generated by the complete left boundary.  The older Wilson
boundary geometry uses the coarse projection J J†, where J is pullback along
the left boundary.

This file proves that these are the same orthogonal projection on the same
genuine joint L2 carrier.  The only measure-theoretic input is Doob-Dynkin
factorization of a strongly measurable representative together with the exact
measure-preserving fst marginal map.

Consequently, on a right-boundary lift R u,
  C_left (R u) = J (D u)
and their norms equal ||D u||.  Thus the retained-boundary contraction isolated
in #4944 is exactly a Doob-boundary L2 contraction; no new quantitative
estimate is asserted here.
-/

