  groundStateJointOneLinkBoundedCoreSpecialUnitaryMeasurableSpace
  groundStateJointOneLinkBoundedCoreSpecialUnitaryBorelSpace
  groundStateJointOneLinkBoundedCoreSpatialLinkFintype

